^[^ ]+ context: RECYCLE .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ host: HOST .* \(danger\)$
^[^ ]+ pulls: (APPROVED[A-Z-]*|RED|CHANGES|THREADS|COPILOT|COMMENTED|MERGED) .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ workers: WORKER [^ ]+ (blocked|error|dead/disappeared) \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ [a-z]+: STATE RESET .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ [a-z]+: [a-z]+ HEARTBEAT STALE \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ todo: TODO [0-9]+ new: .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ todo: TODO READFAIL .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ answers: ANSWER [^:]+: .* \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ answers: DISMISSED [^ ]+ \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ answers: REMIND [^ ]+ [0-9-]+ [0-9:]+ \(start\)$
^[^ ]+ balance: SLOT (KILLED|RUNLONG) .*\(start\)$
